            <section class="prose-section" id="which-to-choose">
                <h2>Which should you choose?</h2>
                <p>Choose Happy Scale if you want a polished smoothing trend, predictions, and milestones, and a subscription (or lifetime unlock) is fine. Choose WeekScale if you want calendar-week comparisons, a one-time price, and data that never needs the internet.</p>
                <p>Both can be the right answer. It depends which trade you would rather make. For the details behind WeekScale's privacy choices, read <a class="inline-link" href="/private-weight-tracker">what local-first storage means</a>.</p>
